MEMORANDUM
TO:
Mayor Marian Orr, and City Council
FROM:
Sara Vasquez, Purchasing Manager 6('
DATE:
April 17, 2018
SUBJECT:
Consideration to purchase Motorola APX7500 Complete Vehicle 2-Way Radio
Systems and chargers from Wireless Advanced Communications, Evans Co.
The Police Department is needing to purchase fifteen (15) Motorola Dual-Band APX7500
Complete Vehicle 2-Way radios and three (3) Motorola portable radio vehicle chargers in the
amount of $87,714.60.
This is a single source purchase through Wireless Advanced Communications, Evans, CO. They
are the sole provider for Motorola in this region.
Funding Source:
025-21-2111-41-46528 (Homeland Security)
022-26-2613-42-43201 (15-18 1 % Sales Tax)
030-15-1540-41-86903 (Spec Purpose Option Tax)
```

